Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《金刚狼》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,(加拿大西北部 1845年)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是体弱多病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前还不是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were sick when you were my age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:01:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有想到你还会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't realize that you're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在陪詹姆斯 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just keeping James company, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's all right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你真贴心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very kind of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有好点吗 儿子? - 还是很冷 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you better, son? - Still cold, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.19,0:01:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只是轻度发烧 早上起来就会好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a mild fever, you'll be all right in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是那样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你也总是会好呀 难道不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you always pull through, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在... 吃药吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now... take your medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉莎白！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉莎白！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸又喝醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's drunk again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你该带他回家 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should help him home, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他找的人又不是我 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my name he's calling, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸! - 待在床上 儿子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father! - Stay where you are, James!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 永远不要再回到这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you never to come back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有一些你不懂的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are things you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别... - 我需要他知道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't... - I need him to know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不再有... 更多的... 谎言!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No... more... lies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他... 他不是你的爸爸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He... he wasn't your father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么怪物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是故意的! 我不是... - 你就是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't mean it! I didn't... - Yes, you did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他罪有应得! 所以你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He deserved it! And you gave it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是兄弟 你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're brothers, Jimmy. You realize that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟会彼此扶持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brothers protect each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在必须要坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to be hard now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,坚强到他们甚至无法对我们动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard enough they can't ever touch us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们都要形影不离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stick together no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉任何阻碍我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take care of anyone who gets in our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到吗 小弟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do that, little brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们追来了 你能跑吗? 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming. Can you run? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一直跑 不要回头看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep on running. Don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,背对背\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back-to-back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's  enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 士兵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down, soldier!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,住手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:07:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,预备!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,结束时叫醒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake me when it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,射击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是威廉史崔克少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Major William Stryker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们被指控谋杀了一位高级军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been charged of killing of a senior officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是那样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明显和当局有一些争端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently we have some issues with authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep a lid on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱长告诉我 你们的判决...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warden tells me that your sentence was carried out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早就由行刑队执行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a firing squad at 1000 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那进行得怎样? - 觉得痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd that go? - It tickled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们厌倦了亡命天涯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys tired of running?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,厌倦否认你们的... 本性?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tired of denying your... true nature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你关心什么? - 喔 我关心...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you care? - Oh, I care...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我关心 因为我知道你们多么与众不同...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I care cause I know how special you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,多有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以待在这 像怪物一样被锁着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stay here, locked up like freaks of nature...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你们可以加入我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you can join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在组织一支特殊的团队...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm putting together a special team...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有着特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with special privileges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在来告诉我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要怎样真正地为你的国家服务?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you like to really serve your country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,普天之下 我最喜欢这件武器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this weapon more than anything in the whole wide world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想知道为什么吗? - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna know why? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它是有纪念意义的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's memorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 把它们带上飞机 是有一点庞大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, it's a little bulky, to have to get 'em on a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你抽出了几把刀...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You whip out a couple of swords...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在你前女友的婚礼上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at your ex-girlfriend's wedding...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们永远也不会 忘记这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will never, ever forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny, Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你错认为 我是可以跟你胡扯的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you confuse me with someone who gives you the shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这或许没有一把枪那么吓人 或者...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's probably not as intimidating as having a gun or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,露宿街头的女人那满是骨头的脚爪或指甲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bone claws or the fingernails of a bag lady...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 修指甲? - 维克多... 放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manicure? - Victor... easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,佛雷纹了新的刺青 我很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred got a new tattoo. I'm concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 佛雷 你昨晚才碰到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh geez, Fred, you just met her last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爱她 - 一夜之后 你就爱上她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love her. - You love her after one night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她是一位体操运动员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a gymnast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱德 降落吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradley, take her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吐吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna puke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们想飞的话 我们会长出翅膀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we were meant to fly, we'd have grown wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 别担心 瞧 更多的人死于车祸 而不是飞机失事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't worry man. See, more people die driving than flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,刺穿怎么样呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about from impaling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 友好一点 或你所认为的友好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, be nice. Or your approximation of nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要一个水桶吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like a bucket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 五分钟之后 飞机就会降落到拉各斯(尼日利亚首都)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, wheels down in Lagos in five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(尼日利亚 拉各斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们为什么在这里? - 待会儿就知道了 零号特工...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are we here? - All in good time. Zero...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维克多 高处的瞭望台 - 很有乐趣?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Victor, high ground lookout. - Having fun yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 佛雷... - 坦克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fred... - Tank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tank. - Yeah, I got that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,和五个吃高蛋白质饮食的人一起被困在电梯里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuck in an elevator with five guys on a high protein diet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喔 韦德! - 梦想真的可以成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh Wade! - Dreams really do come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴! 接着到你上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you just shut it! You're up next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官 你今天气色真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir. You look very nice today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那是苍白而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,严肃一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brings out the seriousness in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我的天 你是不是没有停止过讲话啊 兄弟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, do you ever shut up, pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我醒的时候 没停止过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not when I'm awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱德? 顶楼 拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradley? Top floor, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准电梯! 电梯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover the elevator! The elevator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,工作时间到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,人都死了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你没有那张嘴 韦德...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you haven't that mouth on you, Wade...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会是一位完美的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd be the perfect soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走钻石 都归你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the diamonds, they're yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要你的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want your diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那? 那一文不值 一个纪念品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That? That is nothing. A souvenir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪里找到它? 我想要它的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find it? I want the source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小村庄 内陆深处 距这里三天路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small village, far inland, three days from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说 在我眼里 这块石头比他的命更有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him that this rock is more valuable to me than his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,问他 在哪找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他说 那是从天上掉下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it came from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他讲的是真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会他们的语言 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know their language, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是陨石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a meteor fragment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我问的是 他在哪儿找到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking him where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 基地想要知道我们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, base wants to know our location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让他闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他 这里的每一个人都会死...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him everyone here will die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除非他告诉我 他在哪找到这石头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless he tells me where he found the rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说那是神圣的 - 好的 行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He said that is sacred. - Okay, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,想都不要想!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并没有签约干这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't sign up for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于要在这里做成好事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We finally got a good thing going here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要把这搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you screw this up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 这已经够了 我们已做得够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough, it's enough. We've done enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们所做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你宁愿在一个洞穴里慢慢腐烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you'd rather be rotting in a hole somewhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他们想出对付我们的方法 是这样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till they figure out a way to do it to us, is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你也走吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样让你离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just let you walk away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(加拿大落基山脉 6年后){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么起得这么早?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you up so early?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,回见 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 好甜蜜啊! 是的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's nice! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(俄亥俄州 春田市)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 去那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你这有什么玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把灯关掉 就有大奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turn off the light, you win a prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1块钱2次 - 来吧 我要玩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Two tries for a buck. - Come on, I wanna do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 必须釜底抽薪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, that's obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,2次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个玩笑可不怎么样 - 这不是玩笑 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a stupid trick. - It's not a trick, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,拜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,表演结束了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 表演结束了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, show's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的表演永远不会结束 布莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The show is never over for us, Bradley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维克多 - 不请我进来坐坐吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Victor. - Aren't you gonna invite me in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对 赶紧进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 我什么都没说过...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've never said anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有对任何人... 提起过那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to anyone... about what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在过着一种全新的生活 我不需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm living a totally different life now, but uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,再像过去那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No need to bring up the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,知道么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我总想会是韦德首先来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought it would be Wade coming knocking at my door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.83,0:22:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 韦德已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Wade's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.13,0:22:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕你 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid of you, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道? 你又没有试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know? You've never tried it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,又梦到打仗了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it the wars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.87,0:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪次? - 全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one? - All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,给我说说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.93,0:23:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一点抓痕而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们又得买新被单了 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're gonna need new sheets again, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,政府来找麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It smells like government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天! 你一点也没老!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God! Haven't aged a day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得零号特工探员吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember Agent Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你依然先拔枪后问话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still shooting first and asking questions later?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.11,0:24:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在抽这种便宜的雪茄吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still chewing those cheap cigars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 别闹了 我这有个工作你干不干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, please. I have a job for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我已经有工作了 - 伐木工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I already have a job. - Lumberjack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.49,0:24:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1万8一年? - 1万8千5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eighteen grand a year? - Eighteen five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.83,0:24:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,另外这些日子还不用杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus I haven't had to kill anyone in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.08,0:24:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开始怀念了吗? - 是的 现在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Start to miss it? - Yeah, right now I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.29,0:24:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工 回车里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero, back to the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.85,0:24:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 以这种方式结束我们之间的合作 让我深感不快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm not proud about the way things ended between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谈话结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conversation's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:24:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一个乡村教师厮守与大草原中的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play the little house on the prairie with a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a school teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是你啊 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just isn't you, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.23,0:25:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道吗 哼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you would know, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.69,0:25:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.99,0:25:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样 史崔克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want, Stryker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱德三天前被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradley was killed three days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.62,0:25:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,韦德在这之前也惨遭不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wade, before that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我确信有人正在抓捕我们的队员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that someone is hunting down our whole team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就目前所知 维克多没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as I know, Victor is safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.34,0:25:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不管是谁 总要留下蛛丝马迹的... - 我能照顾好我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoever it is, he's had names, addresses... - I can take care of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.93,0:25:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要这么自私 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not about you, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.77,0:25:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,国家需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Country needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Canadian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚 罗根! 我很清楚你是谁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you, Logan! I know who you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.06,0:26:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.94,0:26:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克今天来过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stryker came by today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.03,0:26:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我拒绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I said no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.49,0:26:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年过去了 他怎么还来骚扰你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he bothering you after all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.58,0:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为在那我是干的最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm the best there is at what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.12,0:26:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是杀人的感觉并不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I do best isn't very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是野兽 罗格 你所拥有的是与生俱来的天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not an animal, Logan. What you have is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.38,0:26:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天赋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.69,0:26:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,宁愿不要这种天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can return a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.73,0:27:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧 伙计!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, fellas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.27,0:27:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别处去了 - 我不会动粗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay in the car. - I'm just gonna ask nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们过去一下好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind lettin' us go by?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.41,0:27:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你有急事吗 朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in some kind of a hurry there, pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.26,0:27:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的车挪一点 我们就可以过去了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just move your truck so we can go by...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.35,0:27:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来谈谈吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to have a conversation there, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.21,0:27:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,事都已经这样了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you start something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.65,0:27:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想敷衍了事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd better be ready to finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 别冲动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey guys, take it easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你男朋友废话太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boyfriend's got a big mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.91,0:27:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.51,0:27:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脾气也大了点 让我们过去 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big temper too, so please, let us pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.44,0:27:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,说服别人 也是一种天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, power of persuasion is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 你的那些能力... 嗯 怎么对我没起作用?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see, do you... uh, have those powers over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.74,0:28:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是没呆在车里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you didn't stay in the car, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,月儿为何如此孤寂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is the moon so lonely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.02,0:28:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.77,0:28:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她曾经一个爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she used to have a lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.19,0:28:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你对孩子们就这样说的? - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You tell this to the kids? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.61,0:28:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字叫库埃阿苏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Kuekuatsheu...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.28,0:28:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一起生活在神界之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they lived in the spirit world together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.13,0:28:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 这是真的 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, it's a true story. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.70,0:28:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,每晚 他们都会一起在天空中漫步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every night, they would wander the skies together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.07,0:28:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可是... 其中的一位神灵心生嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... one of the other spirits was jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.83,0:28:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,崔克斯特想独占月儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trickster, one of the moons from South,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.21,0:28:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉奎库阿苏月儿想要人间美丽的鲜花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he told Kuekuatsheu that the moon had asked for flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.63,0:28:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他怂恿库埃阿苏来到了人间...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told him to come to our world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.57,0:28:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他采摘了一堆野玫瑰...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pick up some wild roses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.63,0:28:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可库埃阿苏不知道的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Kuekuatsheu didn't know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.39,0:29:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦离开神界...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that once you leave the spirit world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就再也回不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can never go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,每天晚上 他都会仰望天空...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every night, he looks up in the sky...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.25,0:29:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看着月亮并呼唤着她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sees the moon and howls her name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.65,0:29:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.03,0:29:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们再也不能拥抱她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can never touch her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,苦艾流苏被恶整了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koo-koo-Kachooka got screwed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.25,0:29:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是库埃阿苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuekuatsheu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.63,0:29:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,原住民语是“金刚狼”的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means the Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.73,0:30:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 罗根?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're doing, Logan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.19,0:32:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是这一带的 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not from around here, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么看出来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gave me away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.87,0:32:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,给你的酒馆上过保险了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got an insurance in this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.85,0:32:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,保险?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insurance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.83,0:32:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.71,0:33:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那可糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 看看 看看... 看看谁大驾光临了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well... Look what the cat dragged in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 不管他是谁 带他出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, whatever this is, take it outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.50,0:33:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,电话不打 信也不写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't call, you don't write.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.55,0:33:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么办法能吸引你的注意力?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else am I supposed to get your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.05,0:34:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不想说出来 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to say it, James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.11,0:34:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白的说 我有点小失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, frankly, I'm a little disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.18,0:34:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.78,0:35:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 吉米 她对你真的那么重要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, Jimmy, was she worth it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.14,0:35:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能明白?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna figure it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟他们不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.94,0:35:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 不像你那么心狠手辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... am nothing like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.75,0:35:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.47,0:35:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是还不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.77,0:36:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发现什么了? - 他在酒吧里打架 几处刀伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we got? - Bar fight. Multiple knife wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.15,0:36:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不是玩笑吧? 这家伙没事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Is this a joke? The guy's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.32,0:36:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.95,0:36:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我他在那! - 我不知道你说的谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said where is he! - I don't know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.35,0:36:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这6年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six years I've been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.84,0:36:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,期间无人问津 你却突然出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knew me and then you show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.63,0:36:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后第二天 她就死了! - 我警告过你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the next day, she's dead! - I tried to warn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.86,0:36:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我是维克多?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell me it was Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.68,0:36:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我用我儿子的生命担保! 我真的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear on my son's life! I didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.15,0:36:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多的欲望不断膨胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor's appetites were becoming too public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.82,0:36:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我得把他关起来 他认为我出卖了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to lock him up. He thought I'd betrayed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.36,0:36:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Went AWOL.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.89,0:37:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他不会放过我们中的任何一个人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he was coming after all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.83,0:37:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是来警告我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't come to warn me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.54,0:37:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为了保住你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came to save your own ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有什么计划 队长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's your plan, captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.13,0:37:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根 你知道你打不贏他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't beat him, Logan, you know you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.17,0:37:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到他杀死他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna find him and kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.51,0:37:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你打败他的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give you the tools to defeat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.18,0:37:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 借此我们也可以拯救他人 - 你是说拯救你自己吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So we can still save the others. - You mean save yourself, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.27,0:37:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应你两件事:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you two things:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你要忍受比常人更多的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll suffer more pain than any other man can endure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.69,0:37:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你能完成复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'll have your revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.36,0:37:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我跟你走 就是下定决心要复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I come with you, I'm coming for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不管法律和约束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No law, no code of conduct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.87,0:37:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我指明方向 然后就他妈的滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You point me in the right direction and you get the hell out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.79,0:38:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,手术一旦开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it starts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.17,0:38:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你来此的理由是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever the reason is that you're doing this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.46,0:38:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,集中意念 也许这样能缓解痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}focus on that. Maybe it will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.63,0:38:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我已经历过比这糟糕的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, I've been through worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.30,0:38:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.01,0:38:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.22,0:38:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会变得无坚不摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna make you indestructible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.35,0:38:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先 我们要摧毁一个旧的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but first, we're gonna have to destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.23,0:38:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得 我们去非洲 要找的是什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what we were looking for in Africa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.86,0:38:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.82,0:38:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.16,0:39:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用它打造了一种... 强大的合金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It helped us create a... metal compound so strong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.12,0:39:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让你能承受住一切攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you will be able to withstand virtually anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是阿德曼钢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called Adamantium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根 我自己无法击倒维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't put Victor down myself, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.59,0:39:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,想要杀了他 你得另辟蹊径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To kill him, you're gonna have to embrace the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.01,0:39:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,变成野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become the animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.06,0:39:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.39,0:39:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要新的刻章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want new ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.61,0:39:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么称号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want them to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.94,0:39:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.13,0:40:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,将军们! 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Generals! Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.55,0:40:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,孟森将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Munson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.93,0:40:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我们将见证医学史的新纪元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, we're gonna witness medical history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.30,0:40:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今天 我们将创造X战警 - X?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Today, we're gonna create Weapon X. - X?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.18,0:40:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马数字的十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman numeral, Ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.23,0:40:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把阿德曼钢 与X战警的骨骼 融合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are about to begin bonding Adamantium to Weapon X's skeleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.65,0:40:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们是兄弟 吉米 - 罗根!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're brothers, Jimmy. - Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.29,0:41:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,体温华氏108度 并持续升高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Body temperature is 1-0-8 and rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.62,0:41:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么在狂抖? 不应该是安安静静的么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he thrashing like that? Why isn't he sedated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他很痛苦 就像我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He feels pain, just like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.17,0:41:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,麻醉药对他不管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anaesthesia won't work on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他必须是自愿接受实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he had to volunteer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.42,0:41:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,心率190次/分 195\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}190, 195.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.01,0:41:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他能活下来么? - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will he survive this? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,心率200次/分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}200.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.64,0:41:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.27,0:41:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,心跳速度远超最大负荷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heartbeat's well beyond maximum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.06,0:41:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 血压? - 260/180\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blood pressure? - 260 on 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.48,0:41:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他能熬过去 他可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can make it, he can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.40,0:41:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.70,0:41:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是野兽 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not an animal, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,意思就是... 金刚狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means... the Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.57,0:42:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he can die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.69,0:43:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 老伙计 醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, old friend. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.99,0:43:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,心率上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heart rate rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.70,0:43:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,阿德曼钢蓄水池已枯竭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adamantium reservoir is depleted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.54,0:43:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有排斥反应 实验成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rejection. Procedure completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.66,0:43:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.66,0:43:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.80,0:43:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要把他带到岛上么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take him to the island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.22,0:43:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,岛上? 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The island? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.72,0:43:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,融合起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bonding works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.77,0:43:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用他的DNA创造下一代XI战警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We use his DNA for the XI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.77,0:43:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,清除他的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erase his memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.11,0:43:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,清除他的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erase his memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.37,0:44:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他听见了你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.84,0:44:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一级防范!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lockdown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.17,0:44:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,捉到他 取下他的首级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunt him down. Take his head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.01,0:45:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,老公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想谷仓里有个裸男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there is some naked man in the barn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.07,0:45:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.22,0:46:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.60,0:46:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟在这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.60,0:46:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很冷 - 冷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's cold. - Cold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.26,0:46:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没有穿衣服 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got no clothes on. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有吸毒 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not onto drugs, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.43,0:46:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.70,0:46:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只是度过了一个糟糕的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just had a rough night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.31,0:46:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 可以这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you could say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到房子里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on up the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.67,0:46:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子有一些旧衣服 也许你能穿得下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of my son's old clothes will probably fit you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.63,0:47:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,接着 盖好身子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, cover it up with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.47,0:47:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想老太太 被你吓得心脏病发作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to give an old lady a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.48,0:47:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你在里面还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.77,0:47:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.73,0:47:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,晚餐已经摆上桌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supper's on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:47:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 好的 我马上就过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... Yeah, I'll be there in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.29,0:48:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓我会赔偿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I'm gonna pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.96,0:48:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放那边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set it down over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.26,0:48:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,过来坐下 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and sit down, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.89,0:48:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,十分感激你们... 为我做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't thank you both enough... for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.89,0:48:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把你留在外面受冻 是很不得体的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wouldn't have been decent to leave you out there to freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.15,0:48:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 得体... - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Decent... - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.40,0:48:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 没什么 我只是还不习惯这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... Nothing, I'm just not really used to that word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.95,0:48:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,外面那机车不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a nice chopper you've got out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.53,0:48:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说摩托车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know motorcycle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.08,0:48:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 又说这个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Lord, here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.79,0:48:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的是1948年的盘状头发动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My favorite is a '48 Panhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.16,0:48:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我买过一辆刚出厂的新车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought one new off the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.45,0:48:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候你还很小呢 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're a little young for that, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.21,0:48:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是累坏了 今晚睡好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be exhausted. You get a good night's sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.46,0:49:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,睡在谷仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the barn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.00,0:49:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那里可没什么东西 能让你打坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing you can break out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.69,0:49:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.19,0:49:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么月儿如此孤寂? - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is the moon so lonely? - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.69,0:49:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她有过一个爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she used to have a lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他却永远不能拥抱着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can never touch her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.30,0:49:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,睡的可好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sleep ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.27,0:49:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.98,0:50:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来 像是要去做一件坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a man fixing to do a bad thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.78,0:50:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道那些想要复仇的人 结局会怎样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happens to man looking for blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.70,0:50:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 会怎样? - 他们都能复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - They find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们都有其他的选择 孩子 - 是的 但我的主意已定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all got a choice, son. - Yeah, mine got taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.96,0:50:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.63,0:50:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我儿子的夹克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was my son's jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.88,0:50:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.11,0:50:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 不客气...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Yep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.70,0:50:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你想骑我的车去兜几圈 测试减震系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna take my bike for a spin, test the suspension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.45,0:50:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1964年 哈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'64, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.91,0:51:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 你真沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you're heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.29,0:51:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 最近重了一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I put on a little weight recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.00,0:51:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.26,0:51:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你穿上太合身了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it fits you beautifully!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.22,0:51:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你带来些...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you some...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.44,0:51:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,X战警在谷仓 他刚害死了两个平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon X is in the barn. He just murdered two civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.23,0:51:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把他炸成碎片 看他还能不能活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow him to bits. Let's see if he can survive that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.47,0:51:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来接我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.57,0:52:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的脑袋炸开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow his brains all over the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.41,0:52:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.86,0:52:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A-1小队 别把他跟丢了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha One, do not lose him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A-2小队 目标正向你靠近!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha 2, target's coming to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.78,0:53:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拉高!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.30,0:54:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back! Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.32,0:54:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.72,0:54:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.26,0:54:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.68,0:55:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工 罗根死了没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero, is Logan dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.41,0:55:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我坠机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know, I'm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.48,0:55:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工 他死了吗 罗根死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero, was he dead, is Logan dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.39,0:55:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工 回话!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.55,0:55:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你企图杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.81,0:55:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.97,0:55:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.22,0:55:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,回基地来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.18,0:55:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会解释一切 我们一起拿下维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll explain everything, we'll take Victor down together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,回答错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.90,0:55:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了维克多之后 就会去杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I've killed Victor, I'm coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.32,0:55:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.40,0:55:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你这样走下去 你会后悔你所看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go down this road, you're not gonna like what you find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.07,0:55:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是你想要头野兽的 上校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted the animal, Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.93,0:55:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你得到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.71,0:55:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were good people back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.63,0:55:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,无辜的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.58,0:56:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣的是 无辜的好人往往都因你而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny how good innocent people tend to die around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.71,0:56:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,零号特工根本没有机会还击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero never stood a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一能制伏罗根的只有阿德曼钢子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that'll take him down is an Adamantium bullet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.55,0:56:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,实验室已经被破坏了 准备撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This facility is compromised. Prep transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.48,0:56:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这快变成一场灾难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, this is turning into a disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.73,0:57:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别担心 我们会阻止罗根的 - 你确定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't worry, we'll stop him. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.07,0:57:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,为了使他坚不可摧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've just spent half a billion dollars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.72,0:57:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经花了五亿美元了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making him indestructible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.28,0:57:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官? - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.68,0:57:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,您要找的小变种人 我们已经找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young mutant you've been looking for, we found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.54,0:57:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 罗根可不是我们唯一的棋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, Logan isn't the only piece in this puzzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.94,0:57:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得从实验室撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to evacuate this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.82,0:57:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请您回华盛顿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, go back to Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.42,0:57:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有活要干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.90,0:57:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说…你说…这个是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo hablo: I talk, tu hablas: you talk, el habla?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.66,0:57:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来翻译一下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody translate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,桑默斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Summers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,坐直了 把太阳镜摘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit up and take off those glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.33,0:57:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我头痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.92,0:57:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那放学后留堂就戴着你的眼镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you can wear them in detention after school{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.42,0:57:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把这个动词变位抄上一百遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you add up this conjugation 100 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.67,0:57:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有人能回答吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.68,0:57:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He talks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.72,0:57:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 是他说的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, he talks. El habla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.72,0:57:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,(拉斯维加斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.23,0:58:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定是维克多？ - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure it was Victor? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.49,0:58:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.86,0:58:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.20,0:58:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我走之后他到底发生了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened to him after I left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.70,0:58:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他变本加厉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.91,0:58:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他觉得是你抛弃了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He felt like you abandoned him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.96,0:58:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 我们都这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, we all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.87,0:58:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是维克多 他必须得证明他比你优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Victor, he had to prove you he was better than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.67,0:58:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他觅寻猎物 想杀就杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunting and killing everything's he was pointin' at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.71,0:58:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,几个月以后我受够了围捕他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quit a few months later myself, couldn't take rounding them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 围捕谁? - 这个你别管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rounding who up? - Leave it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.68,0:58:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,围捕谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rounding who up, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.23,0:58:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! God damn it, John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.31,0:58:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们猎捕自己的同类 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hunted our own kind, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.85,0:58:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在地下设有专门关押这些人的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a special place in hell for the things we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.48,0:58:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,变种人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.82,0:58:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.36,0:58:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克说我们要制造一个特别的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stryker'd say we would make a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.28,0:58:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来保护我们不受侵害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protecting people from the bad ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.87,0:59:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备怎样打败维克多 罗根？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you gonna take Victor down, Logan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我们在非洲的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that stuff in Africa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.63,0:59:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 记得 那又怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I remember Africa, what about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.76,0:59:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.47,0:59:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd they do to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.64,0:59:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别问了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.64,0:59:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 零号特工说了关于一个岛的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Zero said something about an island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.31,0:59:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这是怎么回事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.06,0:59:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.15,0:59:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但也许杜克知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe Dukes knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.82,0:59:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他和零号特工走得很近 - 佛雷杜克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Him and Zero were real tight. - Fred Dukes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.94,0:59:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在哪? - 他就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.28,0:59:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那好 我们去和他谈谈 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, let's go talk to him. - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.24,0:59:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他四点之前是不会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't get in until around four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.16,0:59:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我得提醒你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I gotta warn you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.45,0:59:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他得了饮食障碍症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he developed a bit of eating disorder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.45,0:59:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经有了对策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all got our coping mechanisms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.21,0:59:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,正敦促他减肥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to whoop him back into shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.91,0:59:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你做什么 千万别提他的体重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't mention his weight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.50,0:59:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 佛雷 如果你想回到原样 就得动起来 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Fred, if you want to get into shape, you gotta move, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.92,0:59:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过他得动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him he got to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,佛雷杜克? 被困在怪物里? 那可不是佛雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Dukes? Trapped inside that creature? That ain't Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.97,0:59:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 友好点 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, be nice, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.56,0:59:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 肥... 佛雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Fat, Fred, um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.44,1:00:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 我可记得那姑娘85磅的样子 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I remember that girl when she's got 85 pounds, huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.48,1:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 这可真有趣 你还是那么有意思 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh that's funny. You're still so funny, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.51,1:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道维克多在哪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where Victor is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.24,1:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.32,1:00:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那个岛又是什么 瘦小子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the island, slim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.37,1:00:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,出去的时候可别让门撞了你 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the door hit you on the way out, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.96,1:00:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你不告诉我维克多在哪 我是不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I ain't gonna leave until you tell me where Victor is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.90,1:00:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 老大 帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bob. For old times' sake, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.30,1:00:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才是不是叫我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just call me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.99,1:00:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大胖子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blob?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.55,1:00:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.18,1:00:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你别提他的体重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to mention his weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.50,1:00:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么叫他大胖子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you call him Blob?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.06,1:00:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我没叫他大胖子 我叫的是老大!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't call him Blob, I said Bob!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.52,1:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.69,1:00:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.74,1:00:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的主意? - 我在试着帮你 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is your idea of an idea? - Trying to help you out, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.24,1:00:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杜克并不太喜欢你 这你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dukes don't like you that much, and you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.20,1:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The feeling is mutual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.41,1:00:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,用这双手套 伙计 和他小跳一段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use those gloves, man, dance with him a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.91,1:00:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让他在你身上撒撒气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow him to let his anger out on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.58,1:01:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得如果你这么做...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure if you do that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.64,1:01:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没准他会告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he might tell you everything you wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.67,1:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 伙计 你瞧他那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.54,1:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上衣都快遮不住他那圆滚滚的肚子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big old ass comin' out of the front of his shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.25,1:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 看在上帝的份上 他像快心脏病发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, he's gonna have a coronary for Christ's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.76,1:01:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这有够大的担架...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there even a stretcher big enough...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.99,1:01:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把他抬出去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take this guy out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.39,1:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒不担心他会被担架抬走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't him I'm worried about getting out on a stretcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.76,1:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这混蛋 - 来吧 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're an asshole. - Come on, Logan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.31,1:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,揍他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoop his ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.27,1:01:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.52,1:01:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么 你想和我跳舞吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that suppose to be. You wanna dance with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.11,1:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 噢 这可真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Oh, that feels good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.61,1:01:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你猜怎么着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guess what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.62,1:01:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 他会说的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, he's gonna talk, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.97,1:01:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他伺候好了 他自然会说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got him right where you want him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.24,1:01:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你到底站在哪一边? - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whose side are you on anyway? - come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.58,1:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on now, let's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.58,1:02:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.99,1:02:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 说 维克多在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where is Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.77,1:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得戴太阳镜会看不清吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little dark for sunglasses, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.29,1:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你 不要！求求你 不要！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't! Please! Don't, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.21,1:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.47,1:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.64,1:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多和... 和史崔克在... 在岛上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor's... with Stryker on... on the island...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.35,1:03:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们... 他们一起管理那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they... they run it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.19,1:03:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,什... 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.06,1:03:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多和史崔克在一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor's being with Stryker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.11,1:03:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.86,1:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.05,1:03:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在剩下的就只有罗根了 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that's left now is Logan, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.18,1:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,... 我相信你能办好这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... trust you can handle that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.72,1:04:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也做过 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did before, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.76,1:04:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对 你以前做过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, you did that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.60,1:04:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的交易... 依然有效 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our deal... it still applies, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.36,1:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.61,1:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在把他捆起来 贴上标签 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now pack him and tag him, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.37,1:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个岛是用来做什么的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.54,1:04:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是... 维克多逮捕他们之后 史崔克就带他们去那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's where... Stryker takes them after Victor's caught 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等... 嗯 什么? 带谁去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait... um, what? Takes who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.05,1:04:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,变种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.30,1:04:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有传闻说史崔克拿他们做实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rumor is that Stryker's doing experiments on them there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.31,1:04:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你不会好奇在他们身上发生了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you never wondered what happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.77,1:04:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过不去想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.86,1:05:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了她...为了报仇我才同意把阿德曼钢植入我体内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed her...so I'd let them put Adamantium in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.54,1:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了她就为这该死的实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed her for a goddamn experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.51,1:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那岛在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.43,1:05:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克对此极为保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan, Stryker kept it real secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.23,1:05:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.06,1:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有人从那逃了出来 - 谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A prisoner escaped there once. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.69,1:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫雷米勒伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Remy LeBeau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾经是新奥尔良的街头骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a street hustler from New Orleans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.28,1:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱守卫叫他金牌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guards at the prison called him Gambit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.43,1:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因为玩扑克牌他赢光了他们所有的钱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he kept taking all their money at poker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.84,1:05:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.70,1:05:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克想怎样 他的最终目的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Stryker up to, Fred, what's the end game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.66,1:05:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克想要他们的力量 然后把力量集中起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking their powers, trying to combine them somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.17,1:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道 罗根 我就知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all I know, Logan. It's all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.88,1:06:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我还得回来 那你的脑袋就得搬家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had to come back here, I'm gonna take your head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.22,1:06:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你一起去 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming with you, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.76,1:06:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可不是去救赎什么的 - 我也没这打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's no redemption where I'm going. - I ain't asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.14,1:06:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我们要找的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's our dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.35,1:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.44,1:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把门 免得他跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm gonna go and cover the back if he runs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.73,1:07:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想和他打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not havin' a fight with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.07,1:07:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 是这样 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah right. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.69,1:07:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟每个人都打架吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am havin' fights with everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.15,1:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,狗不是总和猫厮杀吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't dogs kill cats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.24,1:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你去后面望风吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go cover the back, will ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.63,1:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是雷米勒伯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Remy LeBeau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.72,1:07:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I owe you money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.55,1:07:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.85,1:07:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我就是雷米勒伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Remy LeBeau I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.28,1:07:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大盲注一百 小盲注五十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Large blind is 100, and the small blind's 50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.12,1:07:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你也来玩玩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I deal you in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.08,1:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,17块能玩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what can I get for 17 bucks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.25,1:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,17块?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17 dollars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.92,1:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,也许够叫辆出租车回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cab ride home, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.55,1:08:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我弟弟的新保姆吗 约翰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my brother's new babysitter, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.18,1:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是布莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't Bradley, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.02,1:08:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你那件黑大衣也吓不到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your creepy black coat don't scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.89,1:08:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.62,1:08:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,杜克就吃这套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked on Dukes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉 因为我现在就要杀了你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a shame, 'cause now I'm gonna kill you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.82,1:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那么罗根就没有机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so Logan never gets the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.32,1:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪阵风把您给吹来了 先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what brings you to our fair city, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.20,1:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多里德?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor Creed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.37,1:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man I'm gonna kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.91,1:08:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他帮一个叫史崔克的人工作 在一座岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He works for a man named Stryker on, uh, on an island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.13,1:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只要知道岛在哪里 - 你以为我会知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just need to know where it is. - Why would you think I know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.84,1:08:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道你是谁 金牌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, 'cause I know who you are, Gambit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.67,1:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你能从那逃出来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the guy who escaped...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.32,1:08:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你也能带我过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you are the guy who's gonna take me back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.81,1:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 约翰...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, John...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.64,1:08:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想告诉你个事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I always wanted to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.15,1:09:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你很容易判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.40,1:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉得到你的脊椎 可爱的约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel your spine, Johnny Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.70,1:09:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怪了，我不知道你还有脊椎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny. I never knew you had one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.04,1:09:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胸牌不错啊 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are mighty nice tags you have on there, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.88,1:09:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,跟抓走我的那人戴的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men who took me wore tags just like 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.55,1:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老大 听我说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, now Bob, you listen to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.09,1:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那个炼狱里待了两年...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years I was rottin' in that hell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.82,1:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm never going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.76,1:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 真亮啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.51,1:10:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我聊聊 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.31,1:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎样才能杀了我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know how to kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.64,1:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的头切下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna cut your goddamn head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.06,1:10:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if that works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.70,1:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟钝了 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gettin' slow, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.80,1:10:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.68,1:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你得为她的死付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die for what you did to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.50,1:11:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.55,1:11:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这棍法真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a nice stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.65,1:12:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,痞子 你听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shithead. Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.82,1:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去那个岛 我要杀了史崔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, you're gonna take me to this island, where I can kill Creed, Stryker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.16,1:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有所有你憎恶的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pretty much everyone you hate in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.16,1:12:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.20,1:12:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你真要杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really want to kill 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.66,1:12:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你别碍事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you stay out of my way, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.26,1:13:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.56,1:13:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,将军?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.72,1:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是XI武器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Weapon XI?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.39,1:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,集众之长 避众之短\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All their strenghts but none of their weaknesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.61,1:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你很讨厌他们 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really hate them, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.98,1:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't hate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.94,1:13:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他们打了20年的交道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After 20 years of working with them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.59,1:13:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚他们的破坏力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just know what they can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.04,1:13:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果让战争在开始前就结束...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we win this war before it starts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.54,1:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就能拯救无数生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and save countless lives in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.16,1:13:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,先发制人是唯一途径 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preemptive action is the only action here, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.79,1:13:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们国家再也不能坐视不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The days of our country sitting on the sidelines are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.55,1:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要提前进攻...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to take the fight to the enemy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.43,1:13:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在敌人打过来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before they take the fight to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.68,1:13:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我欣赏你的激情 真的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I admire your passion, I do. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.35,1:13:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但到此为止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is as far as it goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.48,1:13:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,X武器是个... 败笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon X was a... a hickup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.77,1:13:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你儿子比尔的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know about your son, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.65,1:13:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道他变异了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know he's a mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.44,1:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道他杀了你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we know he killed your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.41,1:13:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该向我们隐瞒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have kept that from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.95,1:14:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.86,1:14:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这与我的工作毫无关系 - 胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That has nothing to do with my work. - Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.42,1:14:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法逃脱干系 我想你明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too close to this. I'm sure you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.21,1:14:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对 我... 我承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I... I won't lie to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.34,1:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子影响了我的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son did bring the problem home for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.76,1:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但我发誓...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I took an oath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.76,1:14:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要保证民众的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to protect the American people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.18,1:14:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,任何威胁也别想阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from every threat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.56,1:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是外部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both foreign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.36,1:14:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,... 还是内部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and domestic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.87,1:14:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晕机吗 嗯? - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't like flying, huh? - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.00,1:14:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,做好你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just concentrate on what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.33,1:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真没事? 你看你全身都汗湿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure? You got a bit of sweat on your brow there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.12,1:14:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真好笑 你只管好好看路...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny, just keep your eyes on the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.96,1:14:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看啥? 看云么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the what? Clouds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.50,1:15:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机上上下下像个悠悠球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're jumpin' up and down like a freakin' yoyo here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.87,1:15:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪找来这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get this thing anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.09,1:15:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 这可是我的宝贝 一个比赛赢来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is my baby, I won her in a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.38,1:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爪子游戏 - 棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jacks over fives. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.64,1:15:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.39,1:15:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是了 那座小岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. The island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.15,1:15:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,3公里的岛 什么也藏不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three Mile Island. Hiding in plain sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.69,1:15:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能潜入核电站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's gonna sneak around a nuclear reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.40,1:15:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害怕被变成怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think it's gonna turn them into freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.91,1:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,像你一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.20,1:15:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.29,1:15:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.12,1:15:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再不跳就没机会了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause it's now or never. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.75,1:15:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.26,1:15:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 这真能让你变的舒服...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if it's make you feel any better...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.10,1:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得会疼死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is really gonna hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.47,1:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 这是必然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah, it kind of does actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.64,1:15:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.52,1:15:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Likewise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.94,1:16:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.36,1:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.07,1:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一切正常吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.58,1:16:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要多久? - 几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he ready yet? - A few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.33,1:16:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他会听从我的命令吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will respond to my commands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.54,1:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.94,1:17:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.44,1:17:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back to the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.61,1:17:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在我把你开膛破肚之前 告诉我这到底是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before I gut you, I wanna know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.16,1:17:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要将你们的能量传输给"死侍"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed your powers for the pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.57,1:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.33,1:17:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,变种人克星 "死侍"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mutant killer. The dead pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.37,1:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年的研究 就是了为寻找...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years of searching him, to find him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.88,1:17:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找一种完美的能量...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}finding the right powers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.25,1:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能和谐共存而不会相互排斥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that can coexist in one body without ripping it apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.17,1:17:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子是拼图的第一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son was the first piece of the puzzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.68,1:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根 而你是最后一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan, you are the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.10,1:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们完成了XI\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made Weapon XI possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.35,1:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.69,1:18:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你帮忙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you to help but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.38,1:18:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可你却只想平静的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you said you wanted the quiet life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.73,1:18:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.61,1:18:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我看到了前所未有的动力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've learned that nothing motivates...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.88,1:18:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一个男人为了家人而复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the men in your family like revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.01,1:18:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.51,1:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她可是你的老朋友啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she's a real old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.69,1:18:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我们会让你就这样离开吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think we'd just let you walk away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.99,1:18:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a dangerous man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.70,1:18:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我会紧盯危险人物的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to keep an eye on dangerous men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.62,1:18:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他你的死是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him about the day you died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.83,1:19:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给我打了一剂盐酸噻嗪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave me a shot of hydrochloride thiazide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.17,1:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它会让心率变的非常慢...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reduces the heart rate so low...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.45,1:19:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就像死了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it appears you flatline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.73,1:19:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别生她的气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be angry with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.77,1:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,相当受用... 对你们种群来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real credit... to your species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.82,1:19:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 她妹妹的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that her sister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.62,1:19:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,皮肤坚不可摧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has diamond-hard skin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.03,1:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉的能力是触碰催眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla's mutation is tacto-hypnosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.62,1:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她只要碰触别人 就能左右他们思想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can influence people as long as she touches them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.67,1:19:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是很好的引诱工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a useful tool in the seduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.54,1:19:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 从来都是虚幻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never real, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.93,1:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说 真真切切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.93,1:20:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 选择这条路...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you if you came down this road...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.66,1:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢所发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you wouldn't like what you'd found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.65,1:20:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我讲的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That story you told me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.86,1:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,关于男人采花献给月儿的故事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about man who gets flowers for the moon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.41,1:20:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我给改编了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it backwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.37,1:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为你是月儿 我是你的金刚狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were the moon and I was your Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.17,1:20:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但结果你却是个骗子 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were the Trickster, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.54,1:20:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是被你耍的白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am just the fool that got played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.05,1:20:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,最糟的是 我本该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst part of this is I should have known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.14,1:20:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我却忽略了直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I ignored my instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.69,1:20:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,忘记了我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ignored what I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.94,1:20:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事再不会有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that will never happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.85,1:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上校 - 现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Colonel. - Not now, Kayla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.06,1:21:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你要求的 我都做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have done everything you've asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.98,1:21:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.53,1:21:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过如果我帮你 你就放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that if I help you, you'd let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.49,1:21:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉 事情可没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla, it's not as simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.49,1:21:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她的变异很独特 非常美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her mutation is unique. Quite beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.49,1:21:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要多点时间来分析 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need a little more time to analyze it, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.70,1:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你放他走了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let him go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.54,1:21:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维克多 别这样 - 你不能放他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Victor, please. - You can't let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你打不赢他的 - 给我注射阿德曼钢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't beat him, Victor. - Give me the Adamantium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.55,1:21:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 测试结果... - 都说好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tests came out... - We had a deal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.76,1:22:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你撑不过那个手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would never survive the operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.43,1:22:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他能受得了我也能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can take anything he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.95,1:22:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.68,1:22:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我最钟爱的战士 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my favorite soldier, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.60,1:22:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心点 会有时机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be patient, time will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.56,1:22:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他在利用我们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's using us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.70,1:22:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这次怎么样 来真格的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about this time, you die for real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.74,1:22:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.83,1:22:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小伎俩对我没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mind game don't work on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.71,1:22:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.16,1:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels good, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.37,1:23:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怒火中烧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that rage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.42,1:23:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.05,1:23:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.22,1:23:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.68,1:23:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,下手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.89,1:23:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.13,1:24:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.71,1:24:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.63,1:24:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓了我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.22,1:24:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我没有迷惑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I didn't trick you into believing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.60,1:24:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说也是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real for me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.48,1:24:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.52,1:24:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓了我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.48,1:24:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.28,1:24:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,激活11号武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate Weapon XI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.08,1:24:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,熔接还没完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The binding process is incomplete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,照做就是了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.41,1:24:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.01,1:25:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧? 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.59,1:26:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.40,1:26:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太完美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.98,1:26:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯拉 把孩子们带走 - 罗根...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kayla, get these kids out of here. - Logan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.57,1:26:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,另找出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find another way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.98,1:26:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快 我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.90,1:26:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,韦德 是你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wade, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.58,1:26:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克 终于让你闭嘴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess Stryker finally figured out how to shut you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.75,1:26:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,(战斗)
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.55,1:27:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,韦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wade...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.84,1:27:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.80,1:27:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,既然非要动手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, maybe you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.11,1:27:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来人就开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot on sight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.50,1:27:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我能行! 把我对着他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help! Point me at 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.42,1:27:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.88,1:27:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,开火! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.81,1:27:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I get them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.43,1:27:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.45,1:28:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 我不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - I can't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.65,1:28:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.91,1:28:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我得留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.95,1:28:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你带他们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.26,1:28:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.29,1:28:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.91,1:28:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,往左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.23,1:28:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.36,1:28:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 我们得往左走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.20,1:28:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看不见的 - 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't see. - Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.21,1:29:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看你怎麼跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'mon Bob! Let's see your dance up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.21,1:29:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(斩首)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.42,1:29:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我才能杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody kills you but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.31,1:29:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,背对背!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back-to-back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.12,1:29:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在这 - 不 在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him! - Oh no, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.32,1:31:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,停!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.74,1:31:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是这条路 - 就是这条!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This can't be the way. - This is the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.33,1:31:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道? - 我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know? - I just know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.37,1:31:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.51,1:31:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,阿德曼钢子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adamantium bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.93,1:31:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,打穿他的厚脑壳 看他还怎么愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see him heal with a few of these through his thick skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.35,1:31:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了他 用那个也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stop him. Even with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.97,1:32:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是会愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.27,1:32:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑会愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His brain may heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.77,1:32:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但记忆却回不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his memories won't grow back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.79,1:32:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这改变不了我们的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't change anything between us, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.29,1:32:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一刀两断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.80,1:32:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是断不开的 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can never be done, Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.38,1:32:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.34,1:32:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟会互相扶持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brothers look out for each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.25,1:33:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想我了? - 老天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You miss me? - Jesus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.21,1:33:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过要杀了所有人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you said you'd gonna kill everyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.05,1:33:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你在吹牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you may just've been exaggerating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.05,1:33:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.22,1:33:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我像吹牛的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like a man who exaggerates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.56,1:33:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,甭客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.28,1:33:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那些孩子正设法逃离这个岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These kids trying to get off the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.78,1:33:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 分头行动 快! - 这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Split up. Go! - I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.45,1:33:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.50,1:33:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.59,1:33:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.18,1:34:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.69,1:34:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.27,1:34:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要带你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, I'm gonna get you outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.28,1:34:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.11,1:34:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不着急 慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go easy, nice and easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.61,1:34:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.57,1:34:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.74,1:34:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.16,1:34:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,罗根！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.78,1:35:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该让你开枪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should make you pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.16,1:35:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但那和你就没什么两样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that would make us not better than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.17,1:35:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,扔掉枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw the gun away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.17,1:35:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.26,1:36:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,走到你双脚流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk until your feet bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.47,1:36:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再接着走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then keep walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.01,1:36:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 史考特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be all right, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.38,1:36:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我是X教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Charles Xavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.76,1:36:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们一样 我也是变种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a mutant, like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.06,1:36:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能听见你的想法 - 是 我也能听见你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can hear your thoughts. - Yes. And I can hear yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.73,1:36:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.06,1:36:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.51,1:37:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(金刚狼)
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.51,1:37:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kids are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.27,1:37:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.06,1:38:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁? - 你什么意思 我是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - What do you mean, who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是我把你带到这儿的 现在该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the guy who brought you here. Now we gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.07,1:38:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.32,1:38:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, I am a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.91,1:38:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.20,1:38:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.87,1:38:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's my name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.46,1:38:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name is Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.92,1:38:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你得相信我 我们必须得走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to trust me. We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.18,1:38:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.18,1:38:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.93,1:39:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识她吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.43,1:39:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.56,1:39:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那些家伙可不会喜欢你的所作所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These dudes are not gonna like what you've done in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.61,1:39:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We really need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.03,1:39:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find my own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.87,1:39:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.71,1:41:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,史崔克上校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Stryker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.52,1:41:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 威廉史崔克上校? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Colonel William Stryker? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.40,1:41:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,孟森将军死亡一案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wanted for questioning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.65,1:41:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要询问你一些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in connection of the death of General Munson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.60,1:41:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
